<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Canadian Pacific started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Canadian Pacific started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Canadian Pacific Ltd with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said coverage shared by Jim Valentine, railroads, Zev Grossman, energy, and Donald Zwyer, multi-industry.</p>
<p>-- the stock was off 10/16 at 28-15/16 in U.S. trading.</p>
</text>
